{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SizeSemanticToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" depending to viewports \/ size classes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from Figma inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a size token exists with its value depending to the size class, it must be packed in such "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/init(compact:regular:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/compact","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/regular"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/dimension(for:)","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSizeSemanticToken\/isEqual(_:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind"